---
layout: brainbyte.njk
permalink: /brainbyte/guides/index.html
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
title: "Exam prep and guides"
pageTitle: "Free Claude Exam Guides and Practice Questions | BrainByte"
description: "Free prep for the Claude certifications: study guides and practice question banks for CCAR-F, CCAR-P and CCDV-F, with Google Cloud, data engineering and Databricks guides on the way."
---
{#- Guide library, after charliehills.ai/free-resources, grouped by exam:
    each Claude exam (exams.json) shows its free study guide next to its
    practice pack; then the guides still being written (brainbyte.tracks
    without a live guide). -#}
{%- set liveTrackSlugs = [] -%}
{%- for g in bbLiveGuides %}{% set liveTrackSlugs = (liveTrackSlugs.push(g.track), liveTrackSlugs) %}{% endfor -%}

<section class="bb-section bb-section-tight">
  <div class="bb-wrap">
    <span class="bb-kicker">Free</span>
    <h1 class="bb-h1 bg-index-title">Exam prep and guides</h1>
    <p class="bb-lede">Everything for each Claude certification in one place: a study guide that shows how the exam thinks, and a practice question bank to test yourself. One free sign-up to {{ site.newsletter.name }} opens every guide.</p>

    <h2 class="bg-group-title">Claude certifications</h2>
    <div class="ep-grid">
      {%- for exam in exams %}{% set epStyle = "bb" %}{% include "exam-prep-card.njk" %}{% endfor %}
    </div>

    <h2 class="bg-group-title">More guides on the way</h2>
    <div class="bg-cards">
      {%- for t in brainbyte.tracks %}{% if t.slug not in liveTrackSlugs %}
      <div class="bg-card is-soon" style="--track: {{ t.color }}">
        <span class="bb-track-logo"><img src="{{ t.logo }}" alt="" width="32" height="32" loading="lazy" /></span>
        <span class="bb-badge">Coming soon</span>
        <h3 class="bg-card-title">{{ t.title }}</h3>
        <p class="bg-meta">Guide · {{ t.modules.length }} modules · {{ t.level }}</p>
        <p class="bg-card-text">{{ t.pitch }}</p>
      </div>
      {%- endif %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="bb-disclaimer">Independent study material, not affiliated with or endorsed by Anthropic. Contains no actual exam questions.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bb-band" id="newsletter">
  <div class="bb-wrap bb-wrap-narrow">
    {% set newsId = 'guides' %}{% include "bb-newsletter.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>
